    "q-51440": {
      "dom_id": "step-q51440",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "$\\frac{y}{8}+7-\\frac{3y}{8}-11=$",
      "worked_solution": "We collect and combine the like terms, simplifying the coefficients as much as possible:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{y}{8}+7-\\frac{3y}{8}-11 & = \\\\ (\\frac{y}{8}-\\frac{3y}{8})+(7-11) & = \\\\ (\\frac{y-3y}{8})-4 & = \\\\ -\\frac{2y}{8}-4 & = \\\\ -\\frac{y}{4}-4\\end{aligned}\n$$",
